s, LLC (&quot;Securities Markets&quot;), a registered broker-dealer and member of FINRA/SIPC. Securities Markets may provide recommendations at times but does not provide investment advice or ongoing monitoring. No communication herein, or in any medium, should be construed as investment advice or a recommendation to buy or sell any security.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">Securities offered on the Securities Markets Alternative Trading System (ATS) are not registered under the Securities Act of 1933 and may not be offered or sold in the United States without registration or an applicable exemption. Digital assets or tokens utilizing blockchain technology are speculative, involve significant risk, may be illiquid or without value, have limited regulatory certainty, and may be subject to market manipulation. Private placements are also speculative and high-risk; investors must be able to bear the loss of their entire investment.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">Eligibility to trade on the Securities Markets ATS is determined solely by Securities Markets. Any offer or solicitation can be made only through official offering documents describing the risks, fees, and expenses of the applicable securities. Investors should conduct their own due diligence and are encouraged to consult with a financial adviser, attorney, accountant, or tax adviser.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">Past performance is not indicative of future results. Neither the SEC nor any federal or state regulator has recommended or approved any investment or verified the accuracy or completeness of any information herein. Valuations provided by issuers may not reflect market or industry values, and Securities Markets and its affiliates make no representations regarding such information. Securities Markets may collect information about you to comply with anti-money laundering and the USA PATRIOT Act, which requires firms to obtain, verify, and record information that identifies each applicant. The information also helps us understand your investment profile and determine suitability. The term &quot;Investors&quot; as used on this website generally refers to accredited investors where applicable. If we cannot verify the information you provide, we may need to restrict or deny your access. Trading during extended hours carries unique risks, including higher volatility, lower liquidity, wider spreads, and reduced market visibility, and may not be appropriate for all investors. Diversification does not guarantee improved returns or prevent losses. Securities Markets is regulated by FINRA and the SEC; however, membership and registration do not guarantee compliance with all rules. By accessing this site, you agree to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">Crypto services are provided by Zero Hash and are not associated with Securities Markets or its affiliates. Crypto assets are not protected by SIPC, SIPA, or federal securities laws. SIPC protection does not apply to funds held at SIPC-member broker-dealers if such funds are unrelated to eligible securities transactions, intended for the purchase of crypto assets and not recognized as securities under SIPA, or transferred to a crypto platform. Crypto assets are neither cash nor cash equivalents and are not covered by the FDIC. Their value is highly volatile, and they involve increased risks of fraud, cyberattack, and operational failures. Zero-rent LLC and Zero-Reach Liquidity Services are licensed to engage in Virtual Currency Business Activity by the New York State Department of Financial Services.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">EU Disclosures.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">In the European Union, investment services are offered by Securitize Europe Brokerage and Markets, EU, S.A. (&quot;Securitize Europe&quot;), a Spanish investment firm. Securitize Europe, with Spanish tax identification number A05064484, has its registered office at Calle Don Ramon de la Cruz 38, 28001 Madrid, Spain and is registered with the Commercial Registry of Madrid in the sheet number M-784136, page 81 et seq., of volume 41541, section 8, and is authorized, registered and supervised by the Spanish Securities Market Commission, the Comision Nacional del Mercado de Valores (&quot;CNMV&quot;), with registration number 327.</p><p class=\"font-display text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/35\">Securitize Europe has permission to provide investment services in the countries of the European Union listed here.</p></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 flex flex-col items-end\"><button class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 bg-text-black text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-6 h-6\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg></button></div><button class=\"fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-[999] font-mono text-label-sm text-text-gray dark:text-text-secondary bg-white dark:bg-surface-primary-panel border border-border-subtle dark:border-lines-base rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-warm-white dark:hover:bg-surface-sublabel transition-colors shadow-sm\">Reset Entry Flow</button><div class=\"fixed bottom-16 right-4 z-[999] font-mono text-[11px]\"><button class=\"bg-white border border-border-subtle rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-warm-white transition-colors shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-text-gray\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Scenarios<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" heigh