n the sandbox environment has been reached.`,6011:`You cannot move applicant action to pending too often.`,7001:`Invalid email address. Please check the email address and try again.`,7005:`Invalid email address`,8e3:`Your license key has been exhausted. Please renew your subscription or contact support.`,8001:`Your license key has been restricted.`,8002:`Your license key production actions are limited, no checks are allowed.`,9100:`Invalid data provided. Please check correctness of provided data and try again`,9101:`We're experiencing some issues right now. Please try again later.`,9102:`We're experiencing some issues right now. Please try again later.`,9103:`We're experiencing some issues right now. Please try again later.`,9104:`We couldn't verify the data you provided. Please try again later or provide different data.`,9105:`You have made too many attempts. Please try again later or use a different method.`,9106:`Payment was cancelled or not successful. Please try again`,9107:`We cannot verify the data you provided. Please try again with different data.`,9401:`No input to sign provided`,9402:`You need to pass KYC first`,9403:`eSign is experiencing difficulties. Please try again later.`,9501:`No data source is enabled for the selected country`,9502:`Selected state is not supported`,9504:`Couldn't fetch the company data from the corporate registry. Please provide the required information manually.`,9505:`You've exceeded the beneficiaries limit. Contact support for more information`,9506:`Your search returned too many results. Try a more specific search term.`,9600:`Invalid signature or wallet address, try again.`,10402:`Not authorized to access this resource`},idDocErrors:{default:`Make sure that the document is fully visible and all data is readable.`,default_noSelector:`Information from your document cannot be read. Make sure that the data is visible and clear.`,dataNotReadable:`Information from your document cannot be read. Make sure that the data is visible and clear. Also ensure that you selected the right document type and country.`,dataNotReadable_noSelector:`Information from your document cannot be read. Make sure that the data is visible and clear.`,forbiddenDocument:`This document type is not accepted for verification in this country. The accepted documents for this country include:\n\n{docTypes}`,forbiddenDocument_restrictedCountry:`Verification cannot be completed with documents issued in {country} because it's restricted.`,forbiddenDocument_specificDocumentType:`The uploaded {uploadedDocumentType} is not accepted. The approved documents for {country} are:\n\n{docTypesForUploadedIdDocTypeCountry}`,forbiddenDocument_noSelector:`This document type is not accepted for verification.`,graphicEditors:`Make sure your photo isn't edited with a graphics editor.`,expiredDoc:`Your document appears to be expired. Please upload a valid document.`,docExpiresSoon:`Please upload a document with a longer validity period.`,documentWayTooMuchOutside:`Your document does not fit the frame. Upload a new one.`,missingImportantInfo:`Important information is missing or cannot be read. Upload photos that are clear and readable.`,differentDocTypeOrCountry:`The uploaded documents do not match the country or document type selected. Please upload documents consistent with your selections or choose the country and type of document you intend to upload.`,differentDocTypeOrCountry_noSelector:`Information from your document cannot be read. Make sure that the data is visible and clear.`,noIdDocFacePhoto:`Ensure that your face is visible on the document. Upload a new image.`,selfieFaceBadQuality:`Ensure that your face is visible and fits the frame. Please try again.`,shouldBeMrzDocument:`Use a document containing a machine readable zone.`,shouldBeDoublePaged:`Upload both pages of your document as a single.`,shouldBeDoubleSided:`Upload photos of each side of your document separately.`,documentDeclinedBefore:`This document has been uploaded before and is not suitable for verification. Upload a different one`,documentDeclinedBefore_noSelector:`This document has been uploaded before and is not suitable for verification. Upload a different one`,sameSides:`Ensure that you uploaded the front and back side of your document.`,screenshot:`We do not accept screenshots. Upload a new image.`,screenRecapture:`We do not accept photos from a screen. Upload a new image.`,incompleteDob:`Upload a photo of an identity document that contains your full date of birth.`,missingDob:`Upload a photo of an identity document that contains your full date of birth.`,needTranslation:`Upload a certified English translation of your document or try a different identity document with latin characters.`,nfcHardwareMissing:`NFC chip reading is required for this field and only works on mobile devices. To continue, use the {clientName} mobile app to complete your verification.`,shouldBeNfcDocument:`NFC is required, but doc does not contain it.`,grayscale:`We don't accept black-and-white document photos. Upload a color photo.`,digitalDocument:`We don't accept digital documents. Upload a photo of your physical document.`,damagedDocument:`Your document appears to be damaged. Please upload a document in good condition.`,missingValidUntil:`We couldn't find the expiration date on your document. Upload a document that clearly shows its validity period.`,mrzNotReadable:`The machine readable zone on your document cannot be read. Upload a clearer photo.`,mrzNameMismatch:`The name on your document doesn't match the machine readable zone. Please upload a valid document.`,suspiciousDocument:`Your document appears to be suspicious. Please upload a valid, unaltered document.`,missingSignature:`Your document is missing a signature. Please upload a signed document.`,documentAlreadyUsed:`This document has already been used for verification. Please upload a different document.`,missingImportantInfo_noSelector:`Important information is missing or cannot be read. Upload photos that are clear and readable.`,expiredDoc_noSelector:`Your document appears to be expired. Please upload a valid document.`,documentWayTooMuchOutside_noSelector:`Your document does not fit the frame. Upload a new one.`,grayscale_noSelector:`We don't accept black-and-white document photos. Upload a color photo.`,noIdDocFacePhoto_noSelector:`Ensure that your face is visible on the document. Upload a new image.`,selfieFaceBadQuality_noSelector:`Ensure that your face is visible and fits the frame. Please try again.`,shouldBeMrzDocument_noSelector:`Use a document containing a machine readable zone.`,shouldBeDoubleSided_noSelector:`Upload photos of each side of your document separately.`,shouldBeDoublePaged_noSelector:`Upload both pages of your document as a single.`,sameSides_noSelector:`Ensure that you uploaded the front and back side of your document.`,screenshot_noSelector:`We do not accept screenshots. Upload a new image.`,digitalDocument_noSelector:`We don't accept digital documents. Upload a photo of your physical document.`,screenRecapture_noSelector:`We do not accept photos from a screen. Upload a new image.`,damagedDocument_noSelector:`Your document appears to be damaged. Please upload a document in good condition.`,incompleteDob_noSelector:`Upload a photo of an identity document that contains your full date of birth.`,missingDob_noSelector:`Upload a photo of an identity document that contains your full date of birth.`,missingValidUntil_noSelector:`We couldn't find the expiration date on your document. Upload a document that clearly shows its validity period.`,docExpiresSoon_noSelector:`Please upload a document with a longer validity period.`,mrzNotReadable_noSelector:`The machine readable zone on your document cannot be read. Upload a clearer photo.`,needTranslation_noSelector:`Upload a certified English translation of your document or try a different identity document with latin characters.`,mrzNameMismatch_noSelector:`The name on your document doesn't 