t successful. Please try again\"\n        },\n        \"eID\" : {\n          \"instructions\" : \"Follow the instructions on the next screen to complete verification with your electronic ID.\",\n          \"submitData\" : \"Continue\",\n          \"sending\" : \"Submitting…\",\n          \"confirmInstructions\" : \"Complete the authentication using your electronic ID.\",\n          \"confirmActionIn\" : \"Redirecting in {seconds}\",\n          \"confirmAction\" : \"Continue\"\n        },\n        \"options\" : {\n          \"instructions\" : \"Please fill in the required fields to complete the identification process\",\n          \"submitData\" : \"Login\",\n          \"sending\" : \"Redirecting...\",\n          \"confirmInstructions\" : \"Please fill in the required fields to complete the identification process\",\n          \"confirmActionIn\" : \"Redirecting in {seconds}\",\n          \"confirmActionInstructions\" : \"If you are not redirected automatically\",\n          \"confirmAction\" : \"Login\",\n          \"statusRetry\" : \"The action was not successful. Please try again\"\n        },\n        \"sources\" : {\n          \"intl_crd_pennydrop\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Select your banking platform\",\n            \"instructions\" : \"Please select a preferred banking platform to verify your information by making a quick nominal payment. Payment processing may take up to a day, depending on your bank. It will be refunded to you within 48 hours.\",\n            \"confirmAction\" : \"Proceed\"\n          },\n          \"eu_crd_ob\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Select your banking platform\",\n            \"instructions\" : \"Please select a preferred banking platform to verify your information through a standard login process.\",\n            \"confirmAction\" : \"Proceed\"\n          },\n          \"gbr_crd_bank\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Select your banking platform\",\n            \"instructions\" : \"Please select a preferred banking platform to verify your information through a standard login process.\",\n            \"confirmAction\" : \"Continue\"\n          },\n          \"fin_bankid_ftn\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Select your banking platform\",\n            \"instructions\" : \"Please select a preferred banking platform to verify your information through a standard login process.\",\n            \"confirmAction\" : \"Continue\"\n          },\n          \"dnk_bankid_mitid\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Log in to the platform\"\n          },\n          \"ind_gov_aadhaar_digi\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Log in to the platform\"\n          },\n          \"sgp_gov_singpass\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Verify your identity with Singpass\",\n            \"instructions\" : \"Carefully review the information and continue if it is stated accurately.\\nIf you wish to upload an identity document instead, please click ‘Cancel’ and we will redirect you automatically.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"status\" : {\n          \"retry\" : \"Something went wrong. Please try again\",\n          \"rejected\" : \"We cannot verify you. Please check correctness of provided data and try again\"\n        },\n        \"skip\" : \"Verify documents instead\",\n        \"cancel\" : \"Cancel\",\n        \"continue\" : \"Continue\"\n      },\n      \"welcome\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Let's get you verified\",\n        \"reusableTitle\" : \"Complete your verification\",\n        \"fullyReusableTitle\" : \"You're all set to continue\",\n        \"titleCompany\" : \"Let’s verify your company\",\n        \"subtitle\" : \"Follow the simple steps below\",\n        \"reusableSubtitle\" : \"We’ll reuse your previously submitted data to speed things up. You only need to complete the remaining step(s) below:\",\n        \"fullyReusableSubtitle\" : \"We’ll reuse your previously submitted data to speed things up.\",\n        \"subtitleKycAsPartOfKyb\" : \"You’re being verified as part of {companyName}\",\n        \"subtitleKybAsPartOfKyb\" : \"This company is being verified as part of the process for {companyName}\",\n        \"startVerificationButtonLabel\" : \"Start verification\",\n        \"startVerificationButtonLabelMobile\" : \"Start verification on phone\",\n        \"listAriaLabel\" : \"Steps\",\n        \"listAriaLabelReusable\" : \"Reusable steps\",\n        \"listAriaLabelNonReusable\" : \"Non-reusable steps\",\n        \"reusedSteps\" : \"What we'll reuse\",\n        \"remainingSteps\" : \"Remaining steps\",\n        \"stepIndex\" : \"Step {index}\",\n        \"stepStatuses\" : {\n          \"accepted\" : \"Accepted\",\n          \"readyToSubmit\" : \"Ready to submit\",\n          \"rejected\" : \"Rejected\",\n          \"reused\" : \"Submitted\"\n        },\n        \"stepRequired\" : \"Required\",\n        \"continueOnThisDeviceButtonLabel\" : \"Continue on this device\",\n        \"connectWalletButtonLabel\" : \"Connect wallet\",\n        \"signViaExternalWalletButtonLabel\" : \"Sign via external wallet\",\n        \"satoshiTestButtonLabel\" : \"Ownership verification transaction\",\n        \"selfDeclaration\" : \"Self-declaration\",\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\"\n      },\n      \"agreement\" : {\n        \"modalAriaTitle\" : \"Agreements\",\n        \"modalTitle\" : \"Consent to start verification\",\n        \"modalAgreeButtonLabel\" : \"Agree and continue\",\n        \"title\" : \"Data and Privacy\",\n        \"residentTitle\" : \"Confirm your country of residence\",\n        \"text\" : \"Before you continue, you must consent to the processing of your personal data, as described in the {link}\"\n      },\n      \"reusableKycAgreement\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Request to transfer your data\",\n        \"subTitle\" : \"You previously verified with **{partner}**. To speed up your verification with **{client}**, request **{partner}** to transfer your verification data.\",\n        \"reusableDocs\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"The following will be transferred:\",\n          \"IDENTITY\" : \"Identity documents\",\n          \"PROOF_OF_RESIDENCE\" : \"Proof of address documents\",\n          \"EMAIL\" : \"Email\",\n          \"PHONE\" : \"Phone number\",\n          \"EMAIL_AND_PHONE\" : \"Email and phone number\",\n          \"APPLICANT_DATA\" : \"Information you provided about yourself during verification with {partner}\",\n          \"SELFIE\" : \"Selfie\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"liveness\" : {\n        \"switchCameraButtonAriaLabel\" : \"Switch camera\",\n        \"title\" : \"Get your camera ready\",\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"tipsSuccess\" : [ \"Find a well lit place\", \"Ensure your face is within the frame\" ],\n        \"tipsError\" : [ \"Don't wear hats, glasses and masks\" ],\n        \"guides\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"How to pass the selfie check\",\n          \"subtitle\" : \"We are always ready to help! There are some solutions to pass the liveness check with ease.\",\n          \"goodLightingTitle\" : \"Good lighting\",\n          \"goodLightingText\" : \"Help us to recognize your data better, pass the check in a well lit room.\",\n          \"facePositioningTitle\" : \"Correct facial positioning\",\n          \"facePositioningText\" : \"Don't be too close or too far away from the camera. Position your face so that it is clearly visible and correctly fit inside the frame.\",\n          \"unnaturalLookTitle\" : \"Natural look\",\n          \"unnaturalLookText1\" : \"Pass the check without changing your appearance.\",\n          \"unnaturalLookText2\" : \"Don't wear masks, glasses, and hats when passing the liveness check.\"\n        },\n        \"guidelinesButtonLabel\" : \"View our guidelines\",\n        \"completedSplashTitle\" : \"Liveness Check passed successfully\",\n        \"tryAgainButtonLabel\" : \"Try again\",\n        \"errors\" : {\n          \"loading\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Loading error\",\n            \"message\" : \"We could not complete the check. Please try again or use a different device.\"\n          },\n          \"internet\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"You're offline\",\n            \"message\" : \"Check your internet connection and try again\"\n          },\n          \"token\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Verification expired\",\n            \"message\" : \"Contact our support to start new verification.\"\n          },\n          \"notSupported\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Your browser is not supported\",\n            \"message\" : \"Try a different browser or device\"\n          },\n          \"tooLow\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Video quality too low\",\n            \"message\" : \"The video quality does not meet the verification requirements. Please try using a device with a higher quality camera.\"\n          },\n          \"cameraLost\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Camera error\",\n            \"message\" : \"Try again or use a different device\"\n          },\n          \"unknown\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Something went wrong\",\n            \"message\" : \"Try again or use a different device\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"checkResults\" : {\n          \"ALLOW_CONTINUING\" : \"Your data has been submitted.\",\n          \"FAILURE\" : \"We need to scan your face one more time to complete the check.\"\n        },\n        \"alignmentMessage\" : {\n          \"rotate\" : \"Move your head slowly to complete the circle\",\n          \"lookStraight\" : \"Look straight into the camera. Scanning...\",\n          \"loading\" : \"Connecting your camera...\",\n          \"notAligned\" : \"Fit your face into the frame\",\n          \"wasAligned\" : \"Return your face to the frame\",\n          \"rotated\" : \"Look straight into the camera\",\n          \"tooSmall\" : \"Face too far. Please, move closer to the camera.\",\n          \"tooBig\" : \"Face too close. Please, move away from the camera.\",\n          \"wait\" : \"Hold still\",\n          \"analyzingData\" : \"Almost there. Checking...\",\n          \"success\" : \"You're all set\",\n          \"alignmentDirectionHelpMessage\" : {\n            \"right\" : \"Move your head to the right\",\n            \"left\" : \"Move your head to the left\",\n            \"up\" : \"Move your head up\",\n            \"down\" : \"Move your head down\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"shortVideo\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Let's make a short video\",\n        \"stepName\" : \"Short video\",\n        \"guidelinesButtonLabel\" : \"View our guidelines\",\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"tips\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Make sure\",\n          \"success\" : [ \"You’re in a well lit room\", \"There are no other people in the room\", \"Your device’s camera is uncovered and working\", \"Your device’s microphone is working\" ],\n          \"error\" : [ \"You’re not using any mask or software to change your face\" ]\n        },\n        \"guides\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"How to pass the short video check\",\n          \"subtitle\" : \"We are always ready to help! Here are some tips to pass the short video check with ease.\",\n          \"environmentTitle\" : \"Prepare Your Environment\",\n          \"environmentTips\" : [ \"Check your microphone and camera before you start recording the video\", \"Find a quiet, well-lit room with minimal background noise\", \"Ensure the camera is positioned properly, capturing your face clearly\" ],\n          \"instructionsTitle\" : \"Follow Instructions Carefully\",\n          \"instructionsTips\" : [ \"Speak clearly and confidently, ensuring each word is audible\" ],\n          \"speakingTitle\" : \"Speak Naturally\",\n          \"speakingTips\" : [ \"Avoid rushing through the phrase, speak at a moderate pace\", \"Enunciate each word clearly, but don't overemphasize pronunciation\" ],\n          \"checkTitle\" : \"Double-Check Before Submitting\",\n          \"checkTips\" : [ \"Review your recording to ensure it meets the requirements\", \"Verify that the phrase/numbers are pronounced accurately and clearly\" ]\n        },\n        \"capture\" : {\n          \"subtitleDigits\" : \"Say digits out loud and press stop when you’re done.\",\n          \"subtitleWords\" : \"Say the phrase out loud and press stop when you’re done.\",\n          \"footerText\" : \"Keep your full face in the camera view and speak cleary\",\n          \"shutterButtonAriaLabel\" : \"Toggle record\"\n        },\n        \"fastfail\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Let’s record a video again\",\n          \"loading\" : \"Uploading... Keep this tab open until upload is complete\"\n        },\n        \"errors\" : {\n          \"too_short\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Video is too short\",\n            \"subtitle\" : \"The uploaded video does not meet the required minimum video length. Please try recording a longer video.\"\n          },\n          \"too_long\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Video is too long\",\n            \"subtitle\" : \"The uploaded video exceeds the required maximum video length. Please try recording a shorter video.\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"webCameraPhoto\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Let’s make a selfie\",\n        \"tips\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Tips\",\n          \"success\" : [ \"You're in a well lit room\", \"There are no other people in the room\", \"Ensure your face is within the frame\" ],\n          \"error\" : [ \"You're not using any mask or software to change your face\" ]\n        },\n        \"guidelinesButtonLabel\" : \"View our guidelines\",\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"fastFail\" : {\n          \"alertImage\" : \"Image issue\",\n          \"title\" : \"Review your photo\",\n          \"text\" : \"Make sure your face is fully and clearly visible in the photo.\"\n        },\n        \"camera\" : {\n          \"footerText\" : \"Your face should be in the frame and clearly visible\"\n        },\n        \"manualCaptureError\" : \"Unable to take a photo. Please try again\"\n      },\n      \"videoIdent\" : {\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"instructions\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Video identification\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"You will have a video call with operator. It won’t take long\"\n        },\n        \"languageSelector\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Select the language you speak\"\n        },\n        \"readyForCall\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Checking the camera\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"Make sure you’re clearly visible, in a well-lit area, and alone in it\",\n          \"languageTitle\" : \"The language you speak\",\n          \"changeButton\" : \"Change\",\n          \"startCallButtonLabel\" : \"Start Call\"\n        },\n        \"waiting\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Waiting for operator...\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"Please wait while we connect you with one of our identification experts. Simply follow their instructions.\"\n        },\n        \"upload\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Document upload\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"Select identity document for upload\",\n          \"buttonTitle\" : \"Upload {document}\",\n          \"completedTitle\" : \"Done\"\n        },\n        \"enterPhone\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Phone verification\",\n          \"caption\" : \"Enter your phone number to receive a verification code\",\n          \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n          \"errors\" : {\n            \"invalidPhone\" : \"Invalid phone number, try again\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"phoneVerification\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"TAN verification\",\n          \"completedTitle\" : \"TAN verification passed successfully\",\n          \"invalidCode\" : \"The code you entered is incorrect\"\n        },\n        \"endCallPrompt\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"End call\",\n          \"text\" : \"You’re about to exit the verification process. Are you sure you want to exit?\",\n          \"confirmButtonLabel\" : \"Confirm\"\n        },\n        \"errors\" : {\n          \"unknown\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Something went wrong\",\n            \"message\" : \"Try again or use a different device\",\n            \"tryAgainButtonLabel\" : \"Try again\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"satoshiTest\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Confirm your wallet ownership\",\n        \"subtitle\" : \"To verify your wallet, send the amount shown below to the address within 30 minutes\",\n        \"note\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Note: Send the microtransaction from the unhosted wallet you want to verify.\",\n          \"caption\" : \"Do not use exchanges or custodial wallets. Your wallet will not be verified, and the refund may not reach you, as it will be sent back to the sending address, which may be a shared exchange wallet.\"\n        },\n        \"transferDetails\" : \"Transfer details\",\n        \"amount\" : \"Amount\",\n        \"walletAddress\" : \"Wallet address\",\n        \"qrHint\" : \"Scan with your wallet app to send the transaction\",\n        \"submitButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"copied\" : \"Copied to clipboard\",\n        \"copyFailed\" : \"Failed to copy. Please try again.\",\n        \"pending\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Verifying transaction\",\n          \"subtitle\" : \"Please wait while we verify your transaction. This may take a few minutes.\"\n        },\n        \"errors\" : {\n          \"submitFailed\" : \"Failed to submit. Please try again.\"\n        },\n        \"disclaimer\" : {\n          \"paragraph1\" : \"Because you are sending or receiving virtual assets to or from an unhosted wallet, the originating or beneficiary virtual asset service provider is required to verify that you control the relevant unhosted wallet.\",\n          \"paragraph2\" : \"On this page, you will complete this verification by sending a pre-defined amount of virtual assets from the unhosted wallet that should be verified to a designated wallet address (sometimes referred to as a \\\"Satoshi test\\\"). The pre-defined amount of virtual assets used for this verification, less the applicable network fees incurred in connection with the return transfer, will be sent back to your unhosted wallet once the verification has been successfully completed. All network fees are borne by you and are not refunded. No custodial, transfer, or any other services are provided to you as part of this verification.\",\n          \"paragraph3\" : \"Your personal data will be processed by Sumsub in accordance with its {privacyNotice}.\",\n          \"paragraph4\" : \"By sending the pre-defined amount of virtual assets to the designated wallet address, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to the above notice.\",\n          \"privacyNoticeLinkLabel\" : \"Privacy Notice\",\n          \"privacyNoticeLinkUrl\" : \"https://sumsub.com/privacy-notice-service/\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"verificationCompleted\" : {\n        \"success\" : \"Your profile has been verified\",\n        \"trSdkSuccess\" : \"Transaction created\",\n        \"trSdkUpdateSuccess\" : \"Transaction data updated\",\n        \"fail\" : \"Unfortunately, we couldn’t verify you\",\n        \"paymentMethodFail\" : \"Unfortunately, we couldn't verify your payment method\",\n        \"unhostedWalletSuccess\" : \"Your wallet has been verified\",\n        \"trSdkFail\" : \"Unfortunately, we couldn't create your transaction\",\n        \"trSdkUpdateFail\" : \"Unfortunately, we couldn't update your transaction\",\n        \"attestationConsentSuccess\" : \"Attestation created successfully\",\n        \"attestationConsentFail\" : \"Creation of attestation failed\",\n        \"lineaDescriptionSuccess\" : \"You can check it on the {lineaExplorerLinkLabel}\",\n        \"lineaExplorerLinkLabel\" : \"explorer\",\n        \"lineaExplorerLinkUrl\" : \"https://explorer.ver.ax/linea/attestations/my_attestations\",\n        \"kycInKybCloseButtonText\" : \"Go back to the KYB page to complete your company verification\",\n        \"kycInKybCloseButtonLabel\" : \"Go to KYB\",\n        \"closePageMessage\" : \"You may close this page\"\n      },\n      \"reSubmit\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Almost there! Let’s fix a few things\",\n        \"subtitle\" : \"Some details couldn’t be verified. Please review and resubmit the required information to complete your verification.\",\n        \"errorStepsHeader\" : \"Needs resubmission\",\n        \"inProgressStepsHeader\" : \"In progress\",\n        \"successStepsHeader\" : \"All good\",\n        \"stepStatus\" : \"Resubmit\",\n        \"stepInProgressStatus\" : \"Not completed\",\n        \"stepSuccessStatus\" : \"Submitted\",\n        \"startButtonLabel\" : \"Start resubmission\"\n      },\n      \"POA\" : {\n        \"docTypes\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Document types\",\n          \"weAccept\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"We accept\",\n            \"validMonthsTemplate\" : \"Not older than {n} month | Not older than {n} months\",\n            \"validMonthsTemplateShort\" : \"(last {n} month) | (last {n} months)\",\n            \"firstPopularItemsLabel\" : \"{title} {caption}\"\n          },\n          \"weDontAccept\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"We don't accept\",\n            \"list\" : [ \"Screenshots\", \"Receipts for purchases\", \"Medical bills\" ]\n          },\n          \"showMoreButtonLabel\" : \"What else can I upload?\",\n          \"modalTitle\" : \"Document list\",\n          \"customCopyTips\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Requirements\",\n            \"allowed\" : [ ],\n            \"notAllowed\" : [ ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"errors\" : {\n          \"unknown\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Something went wrong\",\n            \"message\" : \"Try again or use a different device\",\n            \"tryAgainButtonLabel\" : \"Try again\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"gps\" : {\n          \"uploadDocumentText\" : \"Upload documents such as bank statements or utility bills to prove your residence address.\",\n          \"uploadDocumentTextVpn\" : \"Upload a document to confirm your address instead.\",\n          \"skip\" : \"Upload document\",\n          \"gpsEntriesError\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Too many location entry attempts\",\n            \"text\" : \"Please try again in a half minute\"\n          },\n          \"retryLocationIn\" : \"try again in {timer}\",\n          \"shareLocationButtonLabel\" : \"Share location\",\n          \"shareLocationAgainButtonLabel\" : \"Share location again\",\n          \"shareLocationAgainInButtonLabel\" : \"Share location again in {timer}\",\n          \"cantShareButtonLabel\" : \"I can't share location\",\n          \"cantTurnOffVpnButtonLabel\" : \"I can't turn off VPN\"\n        },\n        \"docType\" : {\n          \"stepTitle\" : {\n            \"UTILITY_BILL\" : \"Upload a document to confirm your address\",\n            \"UTILITY_BILL2\" : \"Upload your second proof of address document\"\n          },\n          \"stepSubtitle\" : \"The document must show your address\",\n          \"uploadDocumentButtonLabel\" : \"Upload document\",\n          \"uploadAdditionalPageButtonLabel\" : \"Upload additional page\",\n          \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n          \"documentAriaLabel\" : \"Document {index}\",\n          \"additionalDocumentAriaLabel\" : \"Additional page | Additional pages\",\n          \"documentRequired\" : \"Please upload at least one document\",\n          \"documentHintWithPages\" : \"Please include page {pages} | Please include pages {pages}\",\n          \"documentHintWithFields\" : \"Please include page containing {fields}\",\n          \"documentHintWithSide\" : \"Please upload {docSubType} of {docType}\"\n        },\n        \"enterAddress\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Enter your address\",\n          \"subtitle\" : \"Please provide us with your residential address details.\",\n          \"disabledFieldsSubtitle\" : \"Please confirm your residential address details.\",\n          \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n          \"uploadDocumentAlert\" : {\n            \"text\" : \"If we identified your location incorrectly, you can upload a proof of address document to verify it.\",\n            \"uploadButtonLabel\" : \"Upload document\"\n          },\n          \"fields\" : {\n            \"town\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"City\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your city\"\n            },\n            \"street\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"Street\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your street\"\n            },\n            \"subStreet\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"Street (line 2)\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your street (line 2)\"\n            },\n            \"flatNumber\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"Flat number\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your flat number\"\n            },\n            \"buildingNumber\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"Building number\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your building number\"\n            },\n            \"state\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"State\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your state\"\n            },\n            \"postCode\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"Post code\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your post code\"\n            },\n            \"country\" : {\n              \"label\" : \"Country\",\n              \"placeholder\" : \"Enter your country\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"status\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Verifying your data\",\n        \"titleProcessing\" : \"Processing your data\",\n        \"titleDocType\" : \"Verifying your {docType}\",\n        \"titleSlow\" : \"Still verifying, almost done\",\n        \"subtitle\" : \"This may take few minutes. Please wait while we complete the check.\",\n        \"company\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"One last step\",\n          \"title_pending\" : \"Almost there\",\n          \"subtitle_beneficiaries\" : \"To complete your business verification, all associated parties must verify their identity.\",\n          \"subtitle_pending\" : \"To complete your business verification, we need to check the info you provided. It can take up to 1 working day.\",\n          \"checkingInfo\" : \"Checking info\",\n          \"associatedParties\" : {\n            \"verifyNowButtonLabel\" : \"Verify now\",\n            \"remindButtonLabel\" : \"Remind all pending applicants\",\n            \"reminderSentToast\" : \"Reminders have been sent\",\n            \"email\" : \"Email: {email}\",\n            \"sendToEmailButtonLabel\" : \"Send to email\",\n            \"emailSentButtonLabel\" : \"Email sent\",\n            \"copyLinkButtonLabel\" : \"Copy link\",\n            \"linkSent\" : \"Sent to email: {email}\",\n            \"linkCopied\" : \"Link copied\",\n            \"unknownName\" : \"No name\",\n            \"statuses\" : {\n              \"resubmit_requested\" : \"Resubmit requested\",\n              \"awaiting\" : \"Verification required\",\n              \"pending\" : \"Pending review\",\n              \"processing\" : \"Processing\",\n              \"verified\" : \"Verified\",\n              \"rejected\" : \"Rejected\",\n              \"verification_not_required\" : \"No verification needed\",\n              \"under_review\" : \"Under review\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"docTypes\" : {\n          \"IDENTITY\" : \"ID\",\n          \"IDENTITY2\" : \"ID\",\n          \"IDENTITY3\" : \"ID\",\n          \"IDENTITY4\" : \"ID\",\n          \"SELFIE\" : \"selfie\",\n          \"SELFIE2\" : \"selfie\",\n          \"LIVENESS\" : \"liveness check\",\n          \"SHORTVIDEO\" : \"video check\",\n          \"PROOF_OF_RESIDENCE\" : \"address\",\n          \"PROOF_OF_RESIDENCE2\" : \"address\",\n          \"EMAIL_VERIFICATION\" : \"email\",\n          \"PHONE_VERIFICATION\" : \"phone\",\n          \"APPLICANT_DATA\" : \"personal information\",\n          \"QUESTIONNAIRE\" : \"answers\",\n          \"QUESTIONNAIRE2\" : \"answers\",\n          \"QUESTIONNAIRE3\" : \"answers\",\n          \"QUESTIONNAIRE4\" : \"answers\",\n          \"PAYMENT_METHODS\" : \"payment method\",\n          \"E_KYC\" : \"data\",\n          \"SOLANA_ATTESTATION\" : \"Solana attestation consent\",\n          \"LINEA_ATTESTATION\" : \"Linea attestation consent\",\n          \"CHAINLINK_ATTESTATION\" : \"Chainlink ACE attestation\",\n          \"COMPANY\" : \"company details\",\n          \"COMPANY_DATA\" : \"company details\",\n          \"COMPANY_DOCUMENTS\" : \"company documents\",\n          \"COMPANY_BENEFICIARIES\" : \"associated parties\",\n          \"TR_RECIPIENT_INFORMATION\" : \"recipient information\",\n          \"DEVICE_CHECK\" : \"device\",\n          \"videoIdent\" : \"video identification\",\n          \"realTimeIdentificationRecording\" : \"Real-time identification recording\"\n        },\n        \"process\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"We’re verifying your information\",\n          \"subtitle\" : \"This might take a bit. Feel free to leave this page and check later.\",\n          \"subtitleWithContact\" : \"This might take a bit. Feel free to leave this page and check later. If you need any assistance, contact {clientContact}\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"idDoc\" : {\n        \"prompt\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Delete this image\",\n          \"text\" : \"The current image will not be saved.\"\n        },\n        \"docDefNextButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"startDoCapture\" : \"Take photo\",\n        \"addDocumentButtonLabel\" : \"Upload document\",\n        \"bothSides\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Upload your document\",\n          \"subtitle\" : \"Ensure all details on the photo is visible and easy to read\",\n          \"documentType\" : \"Document type\",\n          \"changeDocumentTypeAriaDescription\" : \"Change document type\",\n          \"frontSide\" : \"Front side\",\n          \"backSide\" : \"Back side\",\n          \"frontSidePassport\" : \"Passport photo page\",\n          \"defaultLabel\" : \"Document\"\n        },\n        \"docapture\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Accepted documents: {documentList}\",\n          \"loader\" : {\n            \"uploadingTitle\" : \"Uploading\",\n            \"processingImageTitle\" : \"Processing the image\",\n            \"subtitle\" : \"Please wait a moment\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"docaptureAfter\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Review your photo\"\n        },\n        \"fastFail\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Let’s retake a photo\"\n        },\n        \"docTypes\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Document types\",\n          \"unsupportedDocTypes\" : {\n            \"buttonLabel\" : \"Can’t find my document type\",\n            \"bottomSheet\" : {\n              \"title\" : \"Some documents aren’t available\",\n              \"content\" : \"For some countries, only certain document types can be accepted due to regulatory requirements. If you have a document issued by another country, change the country and try again. \\n\\n In other cases, contact the platform that requested the verification.\",\n              \"closeButtonLabel\" : \"Got it\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"instructions\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Get ready to upload your {documentTitle}\",\n          \"defaultDocument\" : \"ID\",\n          \"tipsSuccess\" : [ \"Scan your document in a well lit room\", \"Avoid reflections on your document\" ],\n          \"tipsError\" : [ \"Don't edit images of your document\" ],\n          \"guidelinesButtonLabel\" : \"View our guidelines\",\n          \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\"\n        },\n        \"continueButton\" : {\n          \"uploadFrontSide\" : \"Upload Front side\",\n          \"uploadBackSide\" : \"Upload Back side\",\n          \"uploadDocument\" : \"Upload document\"\n        },\n        \"errors\" : {\n          \"fileTypeInvalid\" : \"Invalid file type\",\n          \"failedToDeleteImages\" : \"Failed to delete images\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"start\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Verification for {clientName}\",\n        \"titleWalletVerification\" : \"Wallet verification for {clientName}\",\n        \"titleMemberOf\" : \"Verification as part of {memberOfName} for {clientName}\",\n        \"text\" : \"You're about to submit sensitive data to {0}. If you received this link from a suspicious source, please close this page and notify us immediately.\",\n        \"text_extra\" : \"\",\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"logoAlt\" : \"Logo of {clientName}\",\n        \"lineaDemoTitle\" : \"Welcome to Sumsub ID\",\n        \"lineaDemoText\" : \"You're about to submit sensitive data to Sumsub. If you received this link from a suspicious source, please close this page and notify us immediately.\",\n        \"lineaDemoDescription\" : \"Proof of Personhood Verification\",\n        \"walletVerificationText\" : \"To comply with regulatory requirements, you are required to provide more information about this transaction to verify ownership of your wallet. If you received this link from an untrusted or suspicious source, please close this page\"\n      },\n      \"paymentSource\" : {\n        \"capture\" : {\n          \"oneSideTitle\" : \"Front or back of your card\",\n          \"frontSideTitle\" : \"Front side of your card\",\n          \"backSideTitle\" : \"Back side of your card\",\n          \"footerText\" : \"Your card must be in frame and clearly visible\",\n          \"captureFrame\" : \"Capture frame\"\n        },\n        \"captureAfter\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Review your photo\"\n        },\n        \"bankCard\" : {\n          \"stepTitle\" : \"Upload an image of your bank card\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"This will help to confirm that you own the payment method\",\n          \"instructions\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Be sure to show:\",\n            \"tips\" : [ \"First 8 and last 4 digits of your card number\", \"Your full name\", \"Expiration date\" ],\n            \"footnote\" : \"You can cover the CVV code on the back of your card\"\n          },\n          \"backSideSubTitle\" : \"If all the information is on one side of your card, you can upload only one photo\"\n        },\n        \"bankAccountOptions\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Select verification type\",\n          \"label\" : \"Verification type\",\n          \"externalSourcesCheck\" : \"Open banking\",\n          \"bankStatementUpload\" : \"Upload bank statement\",\n          \"errors\" : {\n            \"noAvailableEKycProvider\" : \"No available providers found for this country\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"cryptoWallet\" : {\n          \"stepTitle\" : \"Verify your Wallet ownership with Signed Message\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"\",\n          \"instructions\" : {\n            \"tips\" : [ \"On the next screen, you will see a message that needs to be signed with your wallet address\", \"Simply copy and paste the message into your wallet software and sign it using the private key associated with your wallet address to complete the process\" ]\n          },\n          \"signature\" : {\n            \"tipsTitle\" : \"How to verify wallet ownership:\",\n            \"tips\" : [ \"Copy and paste the provided message into your wallet software\", \"Sign the message using the private key associated with the chosen wallet address\", \"Copy and paste the signed message as Signature Proof\" ],\n            \"message\" : \"Message\",\n            \"copyMessage\" : \"Copy message\",\n            \"copied\" : \"Copied to clipboard\",\n            \"copyFailed\" : \"Failed to copy. Please try again.\",\n            \"walletAddress\" : \"Wallet address\",\n            \"signature\" : \"Signature Proof\",\n            \"signaturePlaceholder\" : \"Paste signed message from your wallet\"\n          },\n          \"verifyWalletInfo\" : \"Verify your wallet information\",\n          \"walletAddress\" : \"Wallet address\",\n          \"assetType\" : \"Asset\",\n          \"cryptoAssetLabel\" : \"{asset} ({chain})\",\n          \"wrongConnectedWalletError\" : \"The wallet address you connected does not match the expected one.\"\n        },\n        \"bankStatement\" : {\n          \"stepTitle\" : \"Upload your bank statement\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"This helps confirm that you own the payment account\"\n        },\n        \"bankAccount\" : {\n          \"stepTitle\" : \"Select verification type\"\n        },\n        \"other\" : {\n          \"stepTitle\" : \"Upload your payment source\",\n          \"subTitle\" : \"This will help to confirm that you own the payment method\",\n          \"instructions\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"You can upload the following document:\",\n            \"tips\" : [ \"A screenshot of the payment service portal containing identifiable information such as the payment service name, unique ID number, email, phone, etc\" ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"continueButtonLabel\" : \"Continue\",\n        \"notice\" : \"All data is held securely and used for verification purposes only\",\n        \"fileUploadLabel\" : \"Payment source\",\n        \"fileUploadDeleteButtonAriaLabel\" : \"Delete {fileName}\",\n        \"selectType\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Select verification type\",\n          \"label\" : \"Verification type\"\n        },\n        \"paymentSourceType\" : {\n          \"bankCard\" : \"Bank card\",\n          \"bankStatement\" : \"Bank account\",\n          \"eWallet\" : \"E-wallet\",\n          \"cryptoWallet\" : \"Crypto wallet\"\n        },\n        \"dataFields\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Payment source\",\n          \"accountIdentifier\" : \"Wallet address\",\n          \"currencyCode\" : \"Asset\",\n          \"cryptoChain\" : \"Crypto chain\",\n          \"loadingAssets\" : \"Loading assets...\"\n        },\n        \"errorScreen\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"We can't verify your wallet\",\n          \"description\" : \"This blockchain isn't supported for verification. Please contact your provider to see what you can do next.\",\n          \"walletAddressLabel\" : \"Wallet address\",\n          \"networkLabel\" : \"Crypto chain\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"walletVerification\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Verify your wallet information\",\n        \"notice\" : \"All data is held securely and used for verification purposes only\",\n        \"signMessage\" : \"I confirm that I am the owner of this wallet and consent to performing a risk assessment and issuing a Verax attestation to this address.\",\n        \"solanaAttestationConsentMessage\" : \"I consent to Sumsub issuing Solana attestations linked to my wallet.\",\n        \"tips\" : [ \"Please connect your crypto wallet. Once connected, you’ll be asked to sign a unique message using your wallet.\", \"This digital signature is free and does not involve any transaction or gas fees.\", \"It simply serves as a secure way to confirm that you are the rightful owner of the connected wallet.\" ]\n      },\n      \"solanaAttestationConsent\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Create your on-chain identity attestation\",\n        \"description\" : \"You’re about to create an on-chain identity attestation using the Solana Attestation Service (SAS)\",\n        \"notice\" : \"No personal documents or images will be stored on-chain\",\n        \"submitButtonLabel\" : \"Create attestation\",\n        \"tips\" : {\n          \"success\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Stand out as a verified user\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Prove you're a real person in the Web3 space.\"\n          },\n          \"repeat\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Skip repeat verifications\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Use your verified status in other apps — no more repeated KYC checks.\"\n          },\n          \"lock\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Your data stays private\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Only a cryptographic proof is stored. No personal info goes on-chain.\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"lineaAttestationConsent\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Create your on-chain identity attestation\",\n        \"description\" : \"You're about to create an on-chain identity attestation using the Linea Attestation Service\",\n        \"notice\" : \"No personal documents or images will be stored on-chain\",\n        \"submitButtonLabel\" : \"Create attestation\",\n        \"tips\" : {\n          \"success\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Stand out as a verified user\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Prove you're a real person in the Web3 space.\"\n          },\n          \"repeat\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Skip repeat verifications\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Use your verified status in other apps — no more repeated KYC checks.\"\n          },\n          \"lock\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Your data stays private\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Only a cryptographic proof is stored. No personal info goes on-chain.\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"chainlinkAttestationConsent\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Request Chainlink ACE attestation\",\n        \"description\" : \"You're about to request an identity attestation through Chainlink Attestation Compliance Engine\",\n        \"notice\" : \"No personal documents or images will be stored on-chain\",\n        \"submitButtonLabel\" : \"Request attestation\",\n        \"tips\" : {\n          \"success\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Stand out as a verified user\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Prove you're a real person in the Web3 space.\"\n          },\n          \"repeat\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Skip repeat verifications\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Use your verified status in other apps — no more repeated KYC checks.\"\n          },\n          \"lock\" : {\n            \"title\" : \"Your data stays private\",\n            \"caption\" : \"Only a cryptographic proof is stored. No personal info goes on-chain.\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"recipientInformation\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"Confirm recipient details\",\n        \"inboundTitle\" : \"Confirm sender details\",\n        \"outboundTitle\" : \"Confirm recipient details\",\n        \"ownWallet\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Is this your own wallet?\",\n          \"options\" : {\n            \"yes\" : \"Yes\",\n            \"no\" : \"No\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"transactionInfo\" : {\n          \"title\" : \"Transaction details\",\n          \"currency\" : \"Currency\",\n          \"walletAddress\" : \"Wallet address\",\n          \"amount\" : \"Amount\",\n          \"form\" : {\n            \"amount\" : \"Amount\",\n            \"amountPlaceholder\" : \"Enter amount\",\n            \"currencyCode\" : \"Currency\",\n            \"currencyCodePlaceholder\" : \"Select currency\",\n            \"cryptoChain\" : \"Crypto chain\",\n            \"walletAddress\" : \"Wallet address\",\n            \"walletAddressPlaceholder\" : \"Paste wallet address\",\n            \"loadingAssets\" : \"Loading assets...\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"form\" : {\n          \"vasps\" : {\n            \"label\" : \"Select VASP\",\n            \"loading\" : \"Loading VASPs...\",\n            \"caption\" : \"The provider that manages the hosted wallet, like an exchange or platform\",\n            \"placeholder\" : \"Select VASP\"\n          },\n          \"applicantType\" : {\n            \"label\" : \"Company or individual\",\n            \"placeholder\" : \"Company or individual\",\n            \"options\" : {\n              \"individual\" : \"Individual\",\n              \"company\" : \"Company\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"unhostedWallet\" : {\n            \"label\" : \"Wallet type\",\n            \"placeholder\" : \"Select wallet type\",\n            \"options\" : {\n              \"hosted\" : \"Hosted wallet\",\n        